Package: pi-aamps
Version: 2.5.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sharad S <admin@pi-aamps.local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, mpv, ffmpeg, alsa-utils, bluez, pulseaudio
Description: Pi Advanced Audio & Music Player System (pi-aamps)
 High-performance, zero-glitch Web OS music engine for Raspberry Pi.
 Features Roon Endpoint, AirPlay Receiver, UPnP/DLNA, 10-Band EQ, and HAT DAC support.
